{"ID":"20240118151107-ndur1pv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151107-ndur1pv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151107-ndur1pv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151107-98fsd2o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135550-spedexk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135550-spedexk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:33,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:33\u0026#125;","title":"222白马茎","type":"doc","updated":"20240201173535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151107-98fsd2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151107-98fsd2o","updated":"20240122135543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，平，无毒，治伤中，脉绝，阴不起，强志，益气，长肌肉，肥健，生子。眼，平。治惊痫，腹满，疟疾。悬蹄，平。治惊邪，瘛瘲，乳难，辟恶气，鬼毒，蛊疰，不祥。生平泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135544-pmzo19o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135544-pmzo19o"}},{"ID":"20240122135550-6qhbdgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135550-6qhbdgi"}},{"ID":"20240122135550-spedexk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135550-spedexk","updated":"20240201173535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那222不用提了，那你开个白马茎1钱根本没有卖的，还要白马的，诸位看看就可以了，现在很难取得。"}]}]}